Task 8:
///Lab: Insufficient workflow validation///

Open the site in burp and log in. Try to buy the jacket. If you do you will get a GET /cart?err=INSUFFICIENT_FUNDS request. Nos lets see what if we actually buy something. Then you will get a 
GET /cart/order-confirmation?order-confirmed=true request. If you check the headers, its all the same. So add the leader jacket to your cart, go to your cart and turn on intercept. Click on the place order.
Forward the POST request, and then you will get the GET /cart?err=INSUFFICIENT_FUNDS request. modify this to GET /cart/order-confirmation?order-confirmed=true and let forward it, and thats all...the lab is solved.

